# Copy this file to `.env` (which is git-ignored) for local builds.
#
# The project's Google OAuth client, compiled into the app so that users only click
# "Connect Google Drive". Leave both empty to build without it: the app then asks each user for
# their own client (Cloud Storage > Advanced), see docs/google-drive-setup.md.
#
# A real environment variable of the same name overrides this file. In GitHub Actions, provide
# them as repository secrets (see docs/release-and-signing.md). Never commit the real values.
L8_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
L8_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
#
# The updater signing key is NOT read from this file. For a release build, set
# TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY and TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY_PASSWORD in your shell only
# (the key lives outside the repository); see docs/release-and-signing.md.
